":"Compare reported scope categories; notes remain attributed and are not adjudicated.","points":[{"definitions_to_check":null,"gap":null,"note":null,"reading":"reading:3a221b9d631f46150704e297","source_term":"MATCHES","state":"all"},{"definitions_to_check":"Hand-built objects: `NormUltrapower B ω := (ultraCon B ω).Quotient` (bounded sequences modulo ω-null), nuclearity via `minTensorNorm`/`maxTensorNorm` defined as `sSup` over representations on Hilbert spaces of one universe, `IsFullGroupAlgebra` (dense span + universal property), `IsCuntzTwoAlgebra` (two Cuntz isometries). Standard formulations, but none is a Mathlib notion, and the tensor-norm `sSup`s are real-valued.","gap":null,"note":"`main_no_embedding : MainStatementWithCuntzCorollary` states: there is a separable unital C*-algebra `A` with `ι : G →* unitary A` satisfying the universal property of the FULL group C*-algebra of `G = (ℤ[1/2])³ ⋊ (SL₃(ℤ) × ℤ)` (`IsFullGroupAlgebra`), and for every nonzero unital nuclear `B` (nuclear = min and max C*-tensor norms agree on `B ⊗ C` for all C) and every free ultrafilter ω on ℕ there is no injective unital *-homomorphism `A →⋆ₐ[ℂ] NormUltrapower B ω`; the same for the universal Cuntz algebra O₂. Exactly the summary, including the O₂ corollary.","reading":"reading:52bfec11183acaa633e4c680","source_term":"full","state":"all"}],"readings":["reading:3a221b9d631f46150704e297","reading:52bfec11183acaa633e4c680"],"state":"agree"},"readings":[{"availability":"recorded","credit":{"atlas_pin":"6f7e5bf965eb85fac44ec93860c456b6a510b344","authors":[{"handle":"carlostoledo1891","name":"Carlos Toledo"}],"kind":"third-party-reported","license":"MIT","method":"Every Comparator challenge re-run on Linux with nanoda switched on, decided by a preregistered rule; every family's challenge statements read against OpenAI's headline, clause by clause. Decider: Comparator (leanprover/comparator d03acab1 = tag v4.34.0, built with the release's toolchain v4.34.1), lean4export 076e8e57, landrun