ert spaces of one universe, `IsFullGroupAlgebra` (dense span + universal property), `IsCuntzTwoAlgebra` (two Cuntz isometries). Standard formulations, but none is a Mathlib notion, and the tensor-norm `sSup`s are real-valued.","note":"`main_no_embedding : MainStatementWithCuntzCorollary` states: there is a separable unital C*-algebra `A` with `ι : G →* unitary A` satisfying the universal property of the FULL group C*-algebra of `G = (ℤ[1/2])³ ⋊ (SL₃(ℤ) × ℤ)` (`IsFullGroupAlgebra`), and for every nonzero unital nuclear `B` (nuclear = min and max C*-tensor norms agree on `B ⊗ C` for all C) and every free ultrafilter ω on ℕ there is no injective unital *-homomorphism `A →⋆ₐ[ℂ] NormUltrapower B ω`; the same for the universal Cuntz algebra O₂. Exactly the summary, including the O₂ corollary.","text":"The challenge statements imply the headline claim after unpacking definitions or one routine step.","url":"https://github.com/mathvet/mathvet/blob/14c7f918cd336d0da03a02aae5a0eed4a429d4db/reviews/openai-math/fidelity-table.csv","verdict":"full"},"source_verdict":"full","state":"all","target":"f:292","target_kind":"family-headline"}],"release_id":"openai-math","remaining_checks":[{"contribution_target":{"fingerprint":"sha256:e81cb47ff4c806199520703466f21248d6dfbb0cfd20a8a4440f234dbc99ed96","grain":"challenge","id":"challenge:NuclearUltrapower","title":"NuclearUltrapower"},"kind":"scope-review","reason":"An AI scope draft has no named human review.","target":"l:NuclearUltrapower"},{"contribution_target":{"fingerprint":"sha256:7768190824a1e18bfe1d6989c16dc1fdfe04791fc230789022c3ed201754f32a","grain":"family","id":"family:292","title":"Kirchberg's \\(\\mathcal O_2\\) norm-ultrapower embedding problem"},"kind":"claim-identification","reason":"Lexical navigation candidate; catalogue headline identity requires review.","target":"f:292"},{"contribution_target":{"fingerprint":"sha256:7768190824a1e18bfe1d6989c16dc1fdfe04791fc230789022c3ed201754f32a","grain":"family","id":"family:292",